#. 本来なら点灯しているはずのランプの数は、
#. <CLT 3>１０個<CLT>じゃなきゃおかしいんだよ！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Ten<CLT> of the lights should have been on. Any other\n"
"number is incredibly suspicious!"
msgstr ""

#. お、おかしいって…どうしてよ…？
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "S-Suspicious...? Why?"
msgstr ""

#. 犠牲になったみんなの事を思い出してみれば、
#. すぐにわかるはずよ…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's simple. Just recall who's died here so far, and\n"
"it should become clear."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犠牲になったみんな…
#. そうだ、そこに謎を解く鍵があるんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's right... That's the key to solving this\n"
"mystery...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１人目の犠牲者は、舞園さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka died first...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>２人目の犠牲者は、江ノ島さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Junko was second...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>３人目の犠牲者は、桑田クン…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leon was third...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>４人目の犠牲者は、不二咲クン…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Chihiro was fourth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>５人目の犠牲者は、大和田クン…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mondo was fifth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>６人目の犠牲者は、石丸クン…
#. ７人目の犠牲者は、山田クン…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Taka was sixth, then Hifumi was seventh...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>８人目の犠牲者は、セレスさん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Celeste was eighth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>９人目の犠牲者は、大神さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura was ninth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして１０人目の犠牲者は、戦刃むくろ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And victim number ten was Mukuro.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？　全部で<CLT 3>１０人<CLT>…？
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hm... So <CLT 3>ten people<CLT> in all?"
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだ。本来なら犠牲者の数は、
#. １０人じゃなきゃおかしいんだよ。
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right. Any other number should make you\n"
"immediately suspicious."
msgstr ""

#. それなのに、生物室に保管されてる死体は、
#. ９人分だけだった…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But according to the lights in the bio lab, only nine\n"
"people were being stored there..."
msgstr ""

#. し、死体が消えたって事か！？
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Y-You're saying a dead body just...up and\n"
"disappeared!?"
msgstr ""

#. わかった！　黒幕が証拠隠滅の為に、
#. 死体を処分しちゃったんだよ！
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I got it! The mastermind destroyed one of the bodies\n"
"to get rid of evidence!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、黒幕が証拠隠滅するなら、自分が関わってる
#. 戦刃むくろの死体を処分するはずだよ…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if they wanted to do that, they would've destroyed\n"
"Mukuro's body, since they actually killed her."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…彼女の死体は残ったままだったんだ。
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And yet...her body was left alone."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…誰の死体が消えちゃったの？
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Then...whose body disappeared?"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、消えた訳じゃないのかもしれない…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It may very well be...that none of them disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. き、消えてないなら…
#. どうして、死体の数が合わないのよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"B-But if that's true, then why doesn't the b-body\n"
"count match...?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマの処刑を含めた殺人は１０回起きたけど、
#. でも、それらの犠牲者は９人しかいなかった。
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Including Monokuma's executions, there have apparently\n"
"been ten deaths. But there were only nine bodies."
msgstr ""

#. …つまり、そういう事よ。
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's the point I'm trying to make."
msgstr ""

#. 全然わかんないよ！
#. なんで、殺人が起きた回数より犠牲者の数が少ないの？
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I'm completely lost! How can the number of victims be\n"
"less than the number of murders!?"
msgstr ""

#. 同じ人物が２回殺された
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The same person was killed twice"
msgstr ""

#. 殺人が起きたのは９回だった
msgctxt "0028 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Only nine murders took place"
msgstr ""

#. 殺人が起きたのは１０回じゃなく９回だったとか…
#. だから、死体の数も９人分しかないんじゃ…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There weren't actually ten murders, but nine! That's\n"
"why there are nine bodies..."
msgstr ""

#. それはないな。
#. モノクマの処刑も含め殺人は１０回あったはずだ。
msgctxt "0030 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's patently untrue. Counting Monokuma's\n"
"executions, there have indeed been ten murders."
msgstr ""

#. それは、俺達自身も、
#. しっかりと確認していたはずだぞ。
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I think we can all agree on that."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かにそうだよな…
#. だったら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Actually, you're completely right. So...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕が死体を処分した
msgctxt "0034 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The mastermind destroyed a body"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり…黒幕が誰かの死体を処分したんじゃ…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Just as I suspected, the mastermind destroyed a body,\n"
"and then—"
msgstr ""

#. 証拠隠滅なら、戦刃むくろの死体を処分するはずだ。
#. 自分の犯罪に深く関わっている死体だからな…
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If they were going to destroy a body, it would have\n"
"been *Mukuro's*. The only one they're connected to..."
msgstr ""

#. それ以外の死体を処分したところで、
#. なんの意味もないはず…お前が言った事だぞ？
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There's no point in destroying any body other than\n"
"that. Didn't you *just* say all that?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう…だったな…
#. だったら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh...yeah, I did. Okay then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれー？　答えられないんだー！
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? Don't you have anything to say!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ…なぜなら…
#. 推理が間違ってるからだよ！
msgctxt "0041 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... It's because you know you're dead wrong!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、間違ってない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No! I'm not wrong!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの致命傷が偽装されてたという事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro's true cause of death has been covered up till\n"
"now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ダメだ。
#. みんなのボクに対する印象が、悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺人が起きた回数より犠牲者が少ない理由…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason there are less bodies than murders...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺人は１０回起きたけど、
#. 犠牲者は９人しかいなかった理由…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The explanation for more murders than victims...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その理由って…なんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why is that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何が起きたら、そんな事になるんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What would it take for that to make sense...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 同じ人物が<CLT 3>２回殺されてる<CLT>としたら…
#. どうなのかな…？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What about if...the same person was <CLT 3>killed twice<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. は…？　２回殺されたって…？
msgctxt "0050 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? Killed twice...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今までに起きた１０回の殺人…
#. その内１回だけは…
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Officially, ten murders have been committed so far."
msgstr ""

#. すでに殺されている人物を、
#. もう１度、殺したものだったのかもしれない…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But one of the victims may have been murdered...and\n"
"then murdered again."
msgstr ""

#. す、すでに殺されてる人物を…もう１度殺した…？
msgctxt "0053 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Murdered and...m-murdered again...?"
msgstr ""

#. それなら、殺人が１０回起きたとしても、
#. 犠牲者は９人しかいないって事になるはずだよね？
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If that's the case, there could have been ten killings\n"
"but still only nine victims, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それは…そうかもしれないけど…
#. でも、そんな事って…！
msgctxt "0055 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"T-Technically you're right I guess, but\n"
"still...something like that—"
msgstr ""

#. …あり得るはず。
#. いえ、間違いなくあったはずよ。
msgctxt "0056 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Could easily have happened. No, it *is* what happened."
msgstr ""

#. もう、わかっているようだな。
#. その２回殺された人物が誰なのかも…
msgctxt "0057 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Sounds like you're already convinced. Then can you\n"
"tell us who was killed twice?"
msgstr ""

#. …もちろん、<CLT 3>戦刃むくろ<CLT>よ。
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It was <CLT 3>Mukuro<CLT>, of course."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、彼女は戦刃むくろとして殺される前に、
#. すでに、別の誰かとして殺されていたのよ。
msgctxt "0059 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Before she was killed as Mukuro Ikusaba, she was\n"
"killed as someone else."
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、その死体は植物庭園で見つけられる前から
#. 生物室に保存されていた…そういう事か。
msgctxt "0060 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And that's why the body had to be stored in the bio\n"
"lab until the moment we found it in the garden..."
msgstr ""

#. いやいや、そりゃないでしょう！
#. 戦刃むくろは別の誰かとして殺されてる…なんて…
msgctxt "0061 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"No no no, that's crazy talk! She was killed as someone\n"
"else? Come on!"
msgstr ""

#. てゆーか、誰だよ！　別の誰かって！
msgctxt "0062 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Besides, who could that \"someone else\" even have\n"
"been!?"
msgstr ""

#. それが誰だったのかは…
#. 彼女の致命傷に注目すれば見えてくるわ…
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"All you have to do is look at those bodily injuries of\n"
"hers and that will become obvious."
msgstr ""

#. 見えてくる訳…ないじゃん…
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Nothing's gonna become obvious...!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、そんなの霧切さんの妄想だもーーん！！
msgctxt "0065 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Because Kyoko's totally delusional!"
msgstr ""
